  You are free to use this code in your own thesis, paper, lab, or defensive
  tooling — just keep the copyright notice and this licence file with any
  substantial copy or redistribution.

  If this work helps your research, a citation of the thesis title is
  appreciated (see README.md). That is courtesy, not a legal requirement.

